      <h2>What the funnel asks</h2>
      <p>The ad clicks through to a page that sorts the dreamers from the buyers. For media walls it asks:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Is it for a chimney breast or a flat wall?</li>
        <li>Do they want an electric fire built in, and roughly what TV size?</li>
        <li>Which town or postcode is it in?</li>
        <li>When are they looking to get it done, and the best number to reach them.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Someone daydreaming won't finish it. A homeowner who's ready to spend on their living room answers it in a minute, and that's the enquiry that lands on your phone.</p>

      <h2>Common questions</h2>
